              {
                "_key": "pe1s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Florial Garden Centre presents its 2025 shipment of palm trees. We have brought in a range of exotic plants suited to suitable growing conditions in Bulgaria. Palms can add a distinctive touch to gardens, courtyards and terraces in Nessebar and Sunny Beach."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe2",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe2s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Why choose palms for your garden?"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe3",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe3s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Palms create a Mediterranean atmosphere and bring elegant greenery to outdoor spaces. Some species adapt well to Bulgaria’s climate and tolerate lower temperatures. For example, the windmill palm (Trachycarpus fortunei) can withstand frost of around −14°C, while the Canary Island date palm grows well in southern areas."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe4",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe4s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Palm varieties"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe5",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe5s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Our range includes relatively cold-hardy palms as well as ornamental species for suitable growing conditions."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe6",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe6s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Trachycarpus fortunei — tolerates frost down to around −14°C and can be planted outdoors in a suitable position."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe7",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe7s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Phoenix canariensis — adds an exotic look; approximate cold tolerance is down to −9°C."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "pe8",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "pe8s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Washingtonia filifera — may tolerate brief cold spells around −10°C and is best suited to regions with mild winters."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
